3. MFE — MOMENTUM–FLUX ENGINE
------------------------------------------------------------

Engine State:
    E(t) = ( M(t), F(t), M̄(t), F̄(t) )

Interpretation:
    M   = Virtue Momentum  (maps to V)
    F   = Terror Flux      (maps to T)
    M̄  = Counter-Virtue   (vice, corruption)
    F̄  = Counter-Terror   (impunity, paralysis)

STRICT MATCH TO ORIGINAL EQUATIONS:
-----------------------------------
Set:
    M = V
    F = T

Emanation rule:
    T = kV
    => F = kM

Revolutionary power:
    P_rev = V * T
    => P_rev = M * F

Peacetime power:
    P_peace = f(V)
    => P_peace = f(M)

Collapse conditions:
    If F = 0:  P_rev = 0
    If M = 0:  P_rev = -∞

Update Rules:
    M(t+1)   = f_M( M, F, M̄, F̄ )
    F(t+1)   = f_F( M, F, M̄, F̄ )
    M̄(t+1)  = f_M̄( M, F, M̄, F̄ )
    F̄(t+1)  = f_F̄( M, F, M̄, F̄ )

MOMENTUM–FLUX ENGINE (EXTENDED)
------------------------------------------------------------

Engine State:
    E(t) = ( M(t), F(t), M̄(t), F̄(t) )

Interpretation:
    M   = Virtue Momentum
    F   = Terror Flux
    M̄  = Counter-Virtue (vice, corruption)
    F̄  = Counter-Terror (impunity, paralysis)

STRICT MATCH:
    M = V
    F = T

Emanation rule:
    T = k(t) * V
    => F = k(t) * M

Revolutionary power:
    P_rev = M * F

Peacetime power:
    P_peace = f(M)

Collapse conditions:
    If F = 0:  P_rev = 0
    If M = 0:  P_rev = -∞

Update Rules (extended):
    M(t+1) =
        f_M( M, F, M̄, F̄ )
      + γ_W * W(t)
      + γ_E * E(t)
      + γ_S * S(t)
      - Σ_i δ_i * F_i(t)
      + ξ_M(t)

    F(t+1) =
        f_F( M, F, M̄, F̄ )
      + η_W * W(t)
      + η_E * E(t)
      + η_S * S(t)
      + Σ_i θ_i * F_i(t)
      + ξ_F(t)

