4. PED — POWER / EVALUATION / DYNAMIC-SLICE
------------------------------------------------------------

PED(E) = ( P(E), Eval(E), D_slice(E) )

4.1 POWER
---------
STRICT MATCH:
    P(E) = M * F

This is exactly:
    P_rev = V * T

4.2 EVALUATION
--------------
Eval(E) = V(M, F, M̄, F̄)

Interpretation:
    legitimacy landscape
    justice constraints
    collapse penalties

Example:
    Eval(E) =
        α * exp(-|M|)
      + β * cos(F)
      + γ * sin^2(M̄)
      + δ * F̄

4.3 DYNAMIC-SLICE
-----------------
D_slice(E) = Φ(E)
or
D_slice(E) ≈ ∇P - ∇Eval

PED — POWER / EVALUATION / DYNAMIC-SLICE (EXTENDED)
------------------------------------------------------------

PED(E) = ( P(E), Eval(E), D_slice(E) )

4.4 POWER
---------
    P(E) = M * F

4.5 EVALUATION
--------------
Eval(E) =
      α(t) * exp(-|M|)
    + β(t) * cos(F)
    + γ * sin^2(M̄)
    + δ * F̄
    - λ_A * A

Interpretation:
    legitimacy landscape
